d content checks. The new flowed text/plain unit cases compare CTE strings only; they do not establish HTML, signing, canonicalization or sent-message behavior.","title":"Unobtrusive main-part encoding relaxes a force flag while the encoder keeps its own checks","version":1,"visibility":"shared"}
